tore/detail/6","text":"東京の寿司！グルメの常識！！お寿司といえば『すしざんまい』！！美味しいお寿司が食べたいと思ったその時は、『すしざんまい』へお越しください！！ご存知マグロ大王が、 世界中から集めてきた選りすぐりのネタを格安でご用意しています！！","blocks":null,"service_name":"kiyomura.co.jp","from_url":"https://www.kiyomura.co.jp/store/detail/6","original_url":"https://www.kiyomura.co.jp/store/detail/6"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q/H7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbcb4b1e-ceb0-476e-ab26-860223e99b64","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"経済が回る店内を回らないお寿司？","ts":"1629365795.142600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fYm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1330345b-da03-4a8c-8ddb-08644babe3a4","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"回らないお寿司を食べたことは数回しかないけど、たまにならありかな～というお値段と味だったので当たりだったのかもしれない。","ts":"1629365563.142000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pukqe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a78ced4-4813-456b-9d32-19239e6ca54a","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"回る回らないお寿司、どこを回るんだろう？","ts":"1629365507.141200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hto"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6210818a-91e8-4df6-b3a3-65cae7747493","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"回る回らないお寿司食べたい","ts":"1629365300.140100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uS/0o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eebe84bc-c20b-4afe-b093-62a459e2b1c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"本物の回らない寿司は難しいのよね…","ts":"1629365284.139600","thread_ts":"1629365284.139600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HgOi3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D597C9D-7E43-4267-BF77-